  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0054_5516d6177572.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{\\mathrm{i}_1}{\\mathrm{i}_2}=\\frac{10}{5}=\\frac{2}{1} \\\\ & \\frac{\\mathrm{P}_1}{\\mathrm{P}_2}=\\frac{\\mathrm{i}_1^2 \\mathrm{R}_1}{\\mathrm{i}_2^2 \\mathrm{R}_2}=\\left(\\frac{2}{1}\\right)^2 \\times \\frac{5}{10}=\\frac{2}{1}\\end{aligned}$"
